Deep (311).png|Energy Absorption
Deep (313).png|Energy Redirection (via Energy Absorption)
I13 (353).png|Intangibility/Technological Destruction
MaxMonster180.png|Flight/Enhanced Speed
SD (420).png|Levitation
MaxMonster181.2.png|Elasticity/Enhanced Strength
RoAE (456).png|Enhanced Durability
SD (417).png|Enhanced Reflexes
HIGaDfY (249).png|Enhanced Dexterity
Deep (306).png|Underwater Breathing/Speed Swimming
</gallery>
Ampfibian can manipulate and produce electricity that is able to stun, paralyze, or kill.{{Refn|group = AP|name = link}} Ampfibian is also able to absorb electrical energy such as lightning and the [[Piscciss Volann (Classic)|Piscciss Volann]] guards' energy nets. That energy then can be launched out of his tentacles as attacks.<ref name="Deep">''[[Deep]]''</ref> Ampfibian is also able to use his electrokinesis to telekinetically move objects, as demonstrated by Ra'ad.<ref name="Fused" />

Ampfibian can generate a protective force field around himself; this feat was exclusively demonstrated by [[Ultimate Aggregor]] during his visit to the [[Perplexahedron]].<ref>''[[Perplexahedron (Episode)|Perplexahedron]]''</ref> 

Similar to [[Upgrade (Classic)|Upgrade]] and [[Buzzshock (Classic)|Buzzshock]], Ampfibian can become pure energy in order to enter electrical cables and control technology. Ampfibian can also generate a large energy blast that surrounds him, as demonstrated by Ra'ad.<ref name="Fused" />

Similar to [[Ghostfreak]] and [[Big Chill (Classic)|Big Chill]], Ampfibian can make himself intangible.<ref name="Fused">''[[Fused]]''</ref> Correlating with this, he is capable of electrically shocking any objects and beings he phases through.<ref>''[[Inspector 13]]''</ref>

Ampfibian can fly and is agile enough to dodge attacks while flying.<ref name="Special Delivery">''[[Special Delivery]]''</ref>

Ampfibian's tentacles can extend multiple times their length.<ref>''[[Night of the Living Nightmare]]''</ref><ref name="Special Delivery" /> Ampfibian also has some degree of enhanced strength, enough to restrain [[Phil Billings (Classic)|Phil]] with his tentacles.<ref name="Max's Monster">''[[Max's Monster]]''</ref>

Due to being boneless, Ampfibian is able to squeeze through small and tight spaces.{{Refn|''[[Ben 10 Ultimate Alien: Power Struggle]]''; [[:File:PS DVD Ampfibian Data.png|file]]|group = DVD}}

Ampfibian is durable enough to withstand being thrown against a wall by [[Solid Plugg]]<ref name="Have I Got a Deal for You">''[[Have I Got a Deal for You]]''</ref> and getting hit by an [[Aerophibian (Classic)|Aerophibian]]'s neuroshock blasts.<ref name="The Rooters of All Evil">''[[The Rooters of All Evil]]''</ref>

Ampfibian can breathe underwater, as well as being able to swim at superhuman speeds. He can also safely produce and discharge electricity underwater.{{Refn|[[:File:Ampfibian Can Safely Discharge Electricity Completely Underwater.PNG]]|group = DM}}<ref name="Deep" />

Ampfibian can read the thoughts of other life forms by sensing the electrical pulses of their minds;{{Refn|[[:File:AmpFibian Can Read Minds.PNG]]|group = DM}}{{Refn|''[[Ben 10 Omniverse: Aliens at War]]''; [[:File:OV AAW DVD Ampfibian Data.png|file]]|group = DVD}}{{Refn|group = AP|name = link}} this feat was only demonstrated by Ra'ad.<ref name="Fused" />

==Weaknesses==
<gallery type="slideshow">
HIGaDfY (233).png|Ineffective Electrokinesis
MaxMonster192.png|Electricity Absorption Vulnerability
RoAE (457).png|Neuroshock Blast Vulnerability
</gallery>
Ampfibian is weak against enemies who can drain electricity, like [[Phil Billings (Classic)|Phil]].<ref name="Max's Monster" /> Furthermore, Ampfibian's electric attacks are useless against [[Solid Plugg]]<ref name="Have I Got a Deal for You" /> because he is made out of super dense rubber.{{Refn|[[:File:Solid Plugg Made of Rubber.png]]|group = DJW}}

Ampfibian can be harmed by an [[Aerophibian (Classic)|Aerophibian]]'s neuroshock blasts.<ref name="The Rooters of All Evil" />

Despite being able to use his electricity underwater, Ampfibian can accidentally shock himself if he is entering or partially in water, as demonstrated with [[Ra'ad]].<ref name="Fused" />

Ampfibian's intangibility is useless against other beings that can also become intangible, as it will cancel out their abilities to do so.<ref>''[[Map of Infinity (Episode)|Map of Infinity]]''</ref>

Ampfibian cannot survive in the vacuum of space as implied by Ra'ad.<ref>''[[Ra'ad]]''</ref><ref>''[[Escape From Aggregor]]''</ref>

==History==
===Ultimate Alien===
*Ampfibian first appeared in ''[[Fused]]'', where his DNA was sampled and put in the [[Codon Stream]] when the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] scanned [[Ra'ad]]'s DNA. [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] remained stuck as Ampfibian due to Ra'ad being trapped in the Ultimatrix until [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]] eventually put the Ultimatrix in Reset Mode.
*In ''[[Deep]]'', Ampfibian swam to [[Piscciss]]' core, along with [[Alien Force|the team]] and [[Pyke]].
*In ''[[Viktor: The Spoils]]'', an unconscious Ampfibian's telepathic abilities were forcibly used to put [[King Xarion]]'s mind in [[Dr. Viktor]]'s body.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/5/53/VTS_Script_Final_Draft.pdf ''Viktor: The Spoils'' Script Final Draft]|group = script|name = final}}
*In ''[[Ben 10-Generator Rex: Heroes United|Ben 10/Generator Rex: Heroes United]]'', Ampfibian appeared as one of the many aliens when Ben was explaining his story to [[Rex Salazar (Generator Rex)|Rex]].
*In ''[[Inspector 13]]'', [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]] as Ampfibian battled several incomplete [[Techadon Robot]]s.
*In ''[[Night of the Living Nightmare]]'', Ampfibian defeated [[Ultimate Kevin]] in a dream.

===Omniverse===

*In ''[[Have I Got a Deal for You]]'', Ampfibian electrocuted [[Pax]], [[Blarney T. Hokestar]], fought [[Solid Plugg]] and saved the [[Screegit]].
*In ''[[Special Delivery]]'', Ampfibian defeated [[Seebik]] and the [[Kraaho]].
*In ''[[Rad]]'', Ampfibian caught Pax.
*In ''[[Max's Monster]]'', Ampfibian was defeated by [[Phil Billings (Classic)|Phil]].
*In ''[[Return to Forever]]'', Ampfibian tried to fight the [[Forever Knights]], but was reverted by their [[DNA Scanner]].
*In ''[[The Rooters of All Evil]]'', Ampfibian was defeated by [[Swift]].
*In ''[[A New Dawn]]'', Ampfibian appeared for a short time when [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] was cycling through his aliens.

