====[[Ben 10 Ultimate Alien: Cosmic Destruction]]====
Ampfibian is one of the [[Andromeda (Classic)|Andromeda Galaxy]] aliens playable in the game.

Ampfibian is vital for progression on The Great Wall and The Amazon levels of the game. He is also the default optional alien for the Eiffel Tower level.

====[[Ben 10: Galactic Racing]]====
Ampfibian is a playable alien racer in the game on the console and 3DS version.

====[[Punch Time Explosion]] and [[Punch Time Explosion XL|XL]]====
Ampfibian is one of the aliens used by [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] as a special attack.

===Online Games===
====[[FusionFall]]====
[[File:Nano ampfibian.png|thumb|AmpFibian Nano in ''FusionFall'']]
The '''Ampfibian Nano''' is a miniature version of Ampfibian that supports the player in [[FusionFall]]. It can be found in a containment unit within DexLabs along with the Flapjack and Sym-Bionic Titan Nanos.

On July 27, 2011, [[Ampfibian (Classic)|Ampfibian]] was released (as the second form of the Unstable Nano) along with Rigby, Gumball, Chowder, Zak Saturday, Titan, and full Nano Johnny Test. On September 14, 2011, his full Nano was released along with the Rath Nano, and Van Kleiss (taking his place as the Unstable Nano).

