==Etymology==
Ampfibian's name is a portmanteau of the words "amp(ere)" and "[[Wikipedia:Amphibian|amphibian]]" (with the "ph" changed to a "pf"). It is also a pun of the word "amplify" ("amp" for short), which means to charge and increase energy, referencing Ampfibian's abilities to absorb, generate, and redirect electrical energy. The word "amphibian" is also used since most are either adapted to water, or generate their own electricity.

==Trivia==
*Ampfibian was the [[Alien of the Month]] in September 2011.
*Ampfibian and the other [[Andromeda (Classic)|Andromeda]] aliens have powers linked to a certain element; for Ampfibian, it is electricity.
*Ampfibian is the only Andromeda alien that [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] used in the same episode he was scanned in.<ref name="Fused" />
*Ampfibian and [[Armodrillo]] are the only Andromeda aliens in '''Ultimate Alien''' to receive a unique transformation sequence. 
*As of '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', Ampfibian and [[Feedback]] are the only aliens who generate blue electricity.
*Ampfibian was designed by [[Steven Choi]] or [[Chap Yaep]],{{Refn|[[:File:Steven and Chap Andromeda.png]]|group = DJW}} and was named by [[Len Wein]].{{Refn|[[:File:Len Wein Named Ampfibian.png]]|group = MW}}
*[[Ben 23]] has an alternate counterpart of Ampfibian.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben 23 Andromeda Aliens.png]]|group = DJW}}
**Years after '''Omniverse''' ended, [[Derrick J. Wyatt]] revealed that [[Ben 23]]'s Amperi transformation was named JellyFritz.{{Refn|[[:File:JellyFritz Proof.png]]|group = DJW}} However, he declined to specify whether it was conceived during or after production.{{Refn|[[:File:Ben 23 Alien Names Revealed After Production.png]]|group = DJW}} Thus, the wiki considers the name non-canon and unofficial.
*Ampfibian was originally not supposed to appear in the dream in ''[[Night of the Living Nightmare]]''.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/d/d4/Night_of_the_Living_Nightmare_Script_First_Draft.pdf ''Night of the Living Nightmare'' Script First Draft]|group = script|name = first}}
*Similar to how [[Jetray (Classic)|Jetray]]'s "Jeffery" nickname originated as a joke amongst the crew, Ampfibian was jokingly referred to as "Aunt Vivian".{{Refn|[[:File:Jeffrey and Aunt Vivian.PNG]]|group = DJW}}

